<title>BANGLADESH: Bangladesh's Beximco Pharma falls 16 percent.</title>
<headline>Bangladesh's Beximco Pharma falls 16 percent.</headline>
<dateline>DHAKA 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bangladesh's Beximco Pharmaceuticals lost 25 taka, or 16 percent, to 135 taka on profit-taking on Thursday, brokers said.</p>
<p>The 10-taka share had been rising since September 1 when it was traded at 86.72 taka, brokers said.</p>
<p>A total of 100,000 shares have changed hands so far on Thursday. The dealings were made maninly between overseas investors, brokers added.</p>
</text>
